{"summary":"百舌窠中土是百舌鸟巢中的泥土，外用可治疗蚯蚓等恶虫咬伤引起的疮肿，以醋调和敷于患处。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《拾遗》）","translation":"出自《拾遗》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"蚯蚓及诸恶虫咬疮，醋调敷之（藏器）。","translation":"治疗蚯蚓及各种恶虫咬伤形成的疮，用醋调和后敷在患处。（出自《藏器》）"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E5%9C%9F%E9%83%A8#百舌窠中土","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:20.994Z"}